    NameEn = CASE WHEN ISNULL(NameEn, N'') = N'' THEN N'LONG LEGGINGS TYRA' ELSE NameEn END,
    DescriptionEn = CASE WHEN ISNULL(DescriptionEn, N'') = N'' THEN N'["<ul><li><p>TYRA women’s long leggings</p></li><li><p>With a scrunch effect to accentuate the glutes</p></li><li><p>Light and breathable</p></li><li><p>Available in 2 colours</p></li><li><p>The TYRA sports bra and long-sleeved sports top are also available</p></li></ul><p>TYRA women’s long leggings are made of smooth, stretchy fabric that provides complete comfort and lightness when worn. The high waist stops the leggings slipping down during exercise and helps them stay in place. The nylon and elastane fabric effectively wicks away sweat during sports activities, allowing freedom of movement, comfort and freshness all day long. They are squat-proof, for worry-free training.</p><p>The model in the photo is 168 cm tall and wears size S.</p><p><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Scrunch effect to accentuate the glutes</p></li><li><p>High waist</p></li><li><p>Squat-proof</p></li><li><p>For complete comfort and an attractive look</p></li><li><p><strong>Composition:</strong> 78% nylon, 22% spandex</p></li><li><p><strong>Colours:</strong> black, purple</p></li><li><p>The TYRA sports bra and long-sleeved sports top are also available</p></li></ul>"]' ELSE DescriptionEn END
